WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.500
Step 7: Early payoff and lien release

2
00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:07.540
Early payoff: the live quote is the loan balance plus interest that grows by the second.

3
00:00:07.540 --> 00:00:14.175
You approve a cap: the balance plus one month of interest. The vault charges the exact amount when it runs.

4
00:00:14.175 --> 00:00:19.714
Paid off: the exact amount went to the lender, and the rest of the cap came back in the same transaction.

5
00:00:19.714 --> 00:00:24.755
The seller or lender then confirms the lien is released on the asset…

6
00:00:24.755 --> 00:00:30.311
…and the vault returns the down payment plus any unswept yield to the buyer. Deal closed.

